            "text": "Want to scale your startup in the U.S. but not sure where to begin?\n\nJoin SelectUSA Tech Webinar — Eurasia Focus for an exclusive session featuring practical tools, resources, and opportunities to help Eurasian startups enter and scale in the U.S.\n\n🎙 Speakers:\n• Stephanie Rothman — SelectUSA Portfolio Manager for Eurasia. \n• Elmira Obry — Select Global Women in Tech alumna & Startup Ecosystem Builder. \n\nWhat you’ll learn:\n✅ How SelectUSA supports international startups expanding to the U.S.\n✅ Key resources from the SelectUSA Investment Summit and SelectUSA Tech program. \n✅ Opportunities to connect with the U.S. startup ecosystem through sessions, pitching, and networking. \n\n📅 January 27, 2026\n🕕 6:00–7:00 PM (Kazakhstan time) | 8:00–9:00 AM (EST)\n🌐 Online\n\n🇺🇸 The webinar will be held in English. \n\n📝For more details, visit the Events section at astanahub.com."
